,"legend":"Journeying folk say a relic monster of 7 ft long inhabits Warwah Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker43","name":"Lefdonete Monster","legend":"Journeying folk say a relic monster of 5 ft long inhabits Lefdonete Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker44","name":"Biton Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 25 ft long."},{"id":"marker45","name":"Comer Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 50 ft long."},{"id":"marker46","name":"Aljabah Ogre","legend":"Whispers speak of a giant Ogre who inhabits Aljabah hills and abducts young women."},{"id":"marker47","name":"Fanah Hydra","legend":"Locals speak of a proud Hydra who inhabits Fanah hills and terrorizes the region."},{"id":"marker48","name":"Rogh Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Uruk Spirits."},{"id":"marker49","name":"Boshead Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Enlandic Totems."},{"id":"marker50","name":"Juhai Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Eurabic Deities."},{"id":"marker51","name":"Thylathle Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Eldar Pantheon."},{"id":"marker52","name":"Yte'aqua Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Eldar Pantheon."},{"id":"marker53","name":"Dhah Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Eurabic Deities."},{"id":"marker54","name":"Hlurtha Tigers","legend":"A gang of forest robbers."},{"id":"marker55","name":"Vrazin Bisons","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker56","name":"Mushayi Badgers","legend":"A gang of mounted highwaymen."},{"id":"marker57","name":"Jorairah Bisons","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker58","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker59","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker60","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker61","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker62","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker63","name":"Bozd Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༺༄༈༇༰༘༼༦༮༰༩༴༿༆༤༨༸༧༖༈༹༫༸་༸༱༳༂༻༜༊༬༄༉༖༔༇༢༠༐༒༧༺༸༇༷༩༐༴༈༯༔༗༺༺༲༜༖༃༓༮༠༻༧༯༚༾༳་ༀ༰༮༭༢༼༷༶༔༮༘༊༴༥༸༾༳༦ༀ་༫ༀ</div>"},{"id":"marker64","name":"Masarqah Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠰ᠒ᢜᢠᢠᠡᡆᡯᡰᠰᡱᡕᢟᡆᡠᢑᡙ᠒ᡒᡎᡯᡒᡒᡙᡙᢡᡙᡴᡗᠨ᠑ᡰᡲᠨᢒᠭᢥᡍᢂᡁᡍᡡᢒᢞᢋᠭᡑᡑ</div>"},{"id":"marker65","name":"Clitneswest Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠽᡴᠱᠱᡑᠯᡖᡓᡁᢛᠿᢦ᠒ᢠᢡᢞᡁᠽᠱᠼᠾ᠒ᢋᢟᡝᡒᡳᠧᡟᢒᠰᠯᡞᡑ᠀ᡖᡜᡟᡀᡕᢞᡞᡜᡑᡔᡆᡒᡆᠠᢥᢏᢢᢢᠿᡎᢤ᠑ᠠᠾᢢᡲᠲᢞᡝᡀᢡᢤᠡᡆᠪᢞᢠᠽᡍᢠᢂᢜ᠐ᡑᢏᠩ᠀ᡜᠩᡏ᠒</div>"},{"id":"marker66","name":"Dobtongli Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ተከደአተከ ጰቀ ገጸከበሰዐሐዘጰዘመረፈ  ወሠጸፐረጠገሐሠቀጠጰቀፐጰከሐደ</div>"},{"id":"marker67","name":"Nathyr Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳎⳫⳐⳜⳚⳈⳌⲲⲼⳢⳘⳐ⳩Ⲳ⳩ⲼⳠⲴ  ⲲⲶ⳧Ⳏ⳹ⳤ⳾ⳒⳬⳀⳈⳃⳊⳃⳢⲶ⳹ⳭⳒⳆⳫⳜⳈⳌ⳾ⳄⳔⳜⳊⳔ⳥⳥Ⲿⳤ⳹ⳢⳞ⳩ⳊⳆⳞⳫⳘ⳥ⳢⲾⳞ</div>"},{"id":"marker68","name":"Qicroz Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༧༥༸༂༼༵༩༷༌༣༩༫༕༧༷༓༓༮༥༑༅༕༦༲༱༳༕༇༸༚༻༃༜་༛༚༅༌༗༢༐༫༕༑༧༤༖༖༡༿༦༩༳༚༹༗༠༸༣༁༙༆༅༊༖༉༷༆༨༷༧༒</div>"},{"id":"marker69","name":"Berleigh Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡟᡴᡍᡁᡭᠮ᠀ᡔᢥᢐᢢᠡᡡᡟᠧᢛᢐᢁᢓᢜᢀᡲᢋᡙ᠐ᠾᡞᢓᢥᢞᡳᢡᡴᡙᡐᡮᡱᡯᡕᢢᡝᡙ</div>"},{"id":"marker70","name":"Thelulal Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc14\udc18\ud802 𐠵𐠔\udc25\udc0f\udc1e\udc21𐠖\udc29\ud802𐠌\udc0b \udc20\ud802\ud802𐠷\ud802 \ud802𐠠\ud802\ud802 \udc26\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠐\udc2e\udc1e\udc3f𐠣\udc20\udc21\ud802 \ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠐\ud802𐠿𐠍\udc27\udc37\udc31𐠭\udc30\udc20 𐠊\ud802𐠮\udc31\udc1c\udc31</div>"},{"id":"marker71","name":"Ruined Sacred site","legend":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker72","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker73","name":"Ruined Settlement","legend":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker74","name":"Ruined Sacred site","legend":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker75","name":"Ruined Fortification","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker76","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker77","name":"Ruined Mausoleum","legend":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker78","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker79","name":"Ruined Castle","legend":"Ruins of an ancient castle. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker80","name":"Zirrizrash Library","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker81","name":"Travelling Extraordinary Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this extraordinary circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker82","name":"Travelling Incomprehensible Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this incomprehensible circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker83","name":"Travelling Fantastical Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this fantastical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker84","name":"Nosbonenil Tournament","legend":"Warriors from around the land gather for a tournament of might in Nosbonenil, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"id":"marker85","name":"Ghrana Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Ghrana, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"id":"marker86","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Ajran River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker87","name":"Geese migration","legend":"A huge group of geese are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker88","name":"Cats migration","legend":"A huge group of cats are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker89","name":"Ibises migration","legend":"A huge group of ibises are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker90","name":"Mantises migration","legend":"A huge group of mantises are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker91","name":"Hlurtheas jubilee","legend":"A jubilee has been organised at Hlurtheas as a chance to gather the nobility of the area together to be merry, make alliances and scheme around the crisis."},{"id":"marker92","name":"Perculiar mirage","legend":"This perculiar mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker93","name":"Entrancing mirage","legend":"This entrancing mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker94","name":"Distant mirage","legend":"This distant mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker95","